                                                    BUSINESS QUESTION
Which ticket categories take the longest to resolve?

Query:
SELECT  
category,
ROUND(AVG(resolution_time_hrs),2) resolve_hrs
FROM customer_support
GROUP BY category
ORDER BY total_resolve_hrs DESC ;

                                                        Finding
Delivery & Shipping tickets had the highest average resolution time, taking about 68.73 hours to resolve compared to the other support categories.

                                               
                                                   Why I investigated it
Since Delivery & Shipping had the longest resolution time, I wanted to understand what might be contributing to the delay. I looked at factors like customer plans, assigned agents,
regions, escalated tickets, reopened tickets, first response time, and the number of customer interactions.

                                                    What I found
After checking these factors, I couldn't find enough evidence to confidently explain why Delivery & Shipping tickets took longer than the other categories. Based on the available data,
the actual reason couldn't be determined.

                                                       Recommendation
I would suggest that we collect more delivery-related information such as shipping status, courier delays, warehouse processing time, inventory availability, or logistics updates.
Having this information would make it easier to identify what is actually causing the longer resolution time.
